{"id":"68f05138bfe79bb6","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-matrix-method.md","title":"Matrix Method","display":"df-matrix-method — Matrix Method","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-matrix-method","aliases":["58-df-matrix-method","Matrix Method"],"display":"df-matrix-method — Matrix Method","depends_on":["[[58-df-integer]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-matrix-method"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-matrix-method</span><span>Matrix Method</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-matrix-method — Matrix Method"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"58-df-integer\">58-df-integer</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,m,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(N,m,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (modulus and dimensions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{r\\times m}(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)\">\\(M\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{r\\times m}(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)\\)</span> (coefficient matrix)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^r\">\\(b\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^r\\)</span> (right-hand side)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in V\">\\(S\\in V\\)</span> (solution-set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MatrixSolutionSet}_S(S,M,b;N,m,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{MatrixSolutionSet}_S(S,M,b;N,m,r)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}matrix\\text{-}method} \\vdash \\mathrm{MatrixSolutionSet}_S(S,M,b;N,m,r)\\leftrightarrow N,m,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land M\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{r\\times m}(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)\\land b\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^r\\land S=\\{x\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^m:Mx=b\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}matrix\\text{-}method} \\vdash \\mathrm{MatrixSolutionSet}_S(S,M,b;N,m,r)\\leftrightarrow N,m,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land M\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{r\\times m}(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)\\land b\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^r\\land S=\\{x\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^m:Mx=b\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Matrix method: use linear algebra to solve congruences; Smith normal form</li>\n<li>The solution set is an explicit output of a total predicate; it is no longer conditionally assigned while the dimensions remain hidden.</li>\n<li>HNW: Hasse-Walstrome; characterize solutions to norm form equations via genus</li>\n<li>Determinant method: bounding solutions to exponential sums via matrix rank</li>\n<li>Lattice reduction: LLL basis for finding small vectors in high-dimensional lattices</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Iwaniec and Kowalski, Analytic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Nguyen and Stehlé, Low-Dimensional Lattice Basis Reduction</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-integer","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integer]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,m,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{r\\times m}(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^r","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MatrixSolutionSet}_S(S,M,b;N,m,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}matrix\\text{-}method} \\vdash \\mathrm{MatrixSolutionSet}_S(S,M,b;N,m,r)\\leftrightarrow N,m,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land M\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{r\\times m}(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)\\land b\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^r\\land S=\\{x\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^m:Mx=b\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1469,"backlinks":[{"id":"c050de49950a0f5f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-824","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-matrix-method.md|58-df-matrix-method]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["244943f88396309f"]}